==Trivia==
* Images of {{wp|Satonda Island}} in Indonesia are used in [[Detective Pikachu Ryme City Guide]] for Cappucci Island, and may have served as inspiration for this location.

===Name origin===
Cappucci comes from ''{{wp|cappuccino}}'', a coffee drink of Italian origin.

